{"artifact_id": "MS-04", "chunk_id": "MS-04:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "7dddae69fca7179e124cf96579860dc00d008583926b0d53806966356c565cb8", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-04", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-018", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "251b46ba0bd9a08d66d57eca44fc8c80cd283289"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": false, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "# MS-04 — Acceptable Alternatives"}
{"artifact_id": "MS-04", "chunk_id": "MS-04:sec:PURPOSE", "content_sha256": "9aaea471e2af4b78e3e5e25c656a35b1077867c62744c2386085e8f25c260b22", "heading": "Purpose", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-04", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-018", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "251b46ba0bd9a08d66d57eca44fc8c80cd283289"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": false, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Purpose\n\nThis artifact catalogues the acceptable-alternative machinery of the 4CH1 mark\nschemes as parsed in the official exam corpus of record (SRC-QPMS-4CH1): the ALLOW\nand ACCEPT annotation classes, product-form and reverse-argument alternatives, and\nalternative scoring routes. The catalogue is read strictly off the parsed text; no\nalternative is invented beyond it. Every claim is carried on a bounded,\nlocator-addressed excerpt from the run's evidence pack. Research artifact; canonical\nplanes untouched."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-04", "chunk_id": "MS-04:sec:SCOPE", "content_sha256": "0ee3687b36ab075a598ff588f88f85943c4db09a27529c7b5a9d066145132f08", "heading": "Scope", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-04", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-018", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "251b46ba0bd9a08d66d57eca44fc8c80cd283289"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": false, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Scope\n\n**Covers:** ALLOW (permitted variants); ACCEPT (equivalent responses); product-form\nalternatives; reverse-argument acceptance; equation-route scoring.\n\n**Grounding:** SRC-QPMS-4CH1 (the 2019-06 2C paper of the pack).\n\n**Out of scope:** mark-loss rules (MS-05), the marking-language inventory's full\nspan (MS-07)."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-04", "chunk_id": "MS-04:sec:EXECUTIVE_SUMMARY", "content_sha256": "749fa5319048efc3e5e8a755de065c2925cc4030a7342066a5e1e39c8ebeb7ca", "heading": "Executive Summary", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-04", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-018", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "251b46ba0bd9a08d66d57eca44fc8c80cd283289"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": false, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Executive Summary\n\nThe mark schemes encode three everyday alternative classes and two structural ones.\nALLOW grants a permitted variant of the required answer (any shade combination for an\nobservation); ACCEPT grants an equivalent response (a paraphrased method step);\nname/symbol pairs are printed inline (bromine/Br2). Structurally, some points accept\na reverse argument, and some can be scored through a different route entirely (a\nproduct in an equation). The breadth of these allowances is itself a finding: at 1-2\nmarks the schemes accept presentation freedom, while the chemistry itself stays\nfixed."}
