{"artifact_id": "MS-04", "chunk_id": "MS-04:sec:EVIDENCE_SOURCE_BASIS", "content_sha256": "12f491708d9bf86c3313b684226951bf97920bf7f709ba082ace6cf01399a1f7", "heading": "Evidence / Source Basis", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-04", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-018", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "251b46ba0bd9a08d66d57eca44fc8c80cd283289"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": false, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Evidence / Source Basis\n\nPrimary evidence: SRC-QPMS-4CH1 — the 2019-06 2C official extraction (60 bounded line-window excerpts, locators preserved; mark-scheme text cited verbatim)."}
{"artifact_id": "MS-04", "chunk_id": "MS-04:sec:LIMITATIONS_COVERAGE_GAPS", "content_sha256": "0ad291d49f1021b47aa5b0ed6ec02cfb1e7b6158842ac6b64750959218f0d847", "heading": "Limitations / Coverage Gaps", "kind": "section", "metadata": {"artifact_id": "MS-04", "artifact_version": 1.1, "curriculum_anchor_refs": [], "curriculum_version": "2017", "provenance": {"generation_run_id": "SIB-CHEMISTRY_4CH1-RUN-018", "generator": {"agent_version": "SIB-GEN-r0", "model": "GLM", "provider": "z.ai"}, "source_manifest": "SRC-QPMS-4CH1", "source_revisions": {"syllabai": "357ace0a230f5e0095ad230320af587dca6bb71f", "syllabai_pastpapers": "2cb92fe5f56d22f1b231c129a7e0dbc27bf86007", "syllabai_resources": "251b46ba0bd9a08d66d57eca44fc8c80cd283289"}}, "qualification": "International GCSE", "record_id": "", "research_family": "mark_scheme_intelligence", "source_scope": {"examiner_reports": false, "mark_schemes": true, "question_papers": true, "specification": false, "supplementary": false, "textbook": false}, "specification": "4CH1", "status": "PUBLISHED", "subject": "Chemistry", "temporal_scope": {"current": true, "legacy": false}}, "record_id": "", "text": "## Limitations / Coverage Gaps\n\nThe catalogue covers the alternative classes visible in the pack's excerpt windows of the 2019-06 2C paper;\nrare allowance forms in other sessions are neither catalogued nor denied. The\nhalogen-displacement scheme is quoted from consecutive windows of one item; its full\nguidance grid extends past the excerpt edges and the unexcerpted remainder is not\nparaphrased. No canonical planes were written."}
